  "worked_solution": "To evaluate our multivariable function at the point $(-4,1),$ we substitute $x=-4$ and $y=1$ into the function expression:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}z\\,{|}_{(-4,1)} & =\\operatorname{ln}\u2061(3x-2y+4)\\,{|}_{(-4,1)} \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}\u2061(3(-4)-2(1)+4) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}\u2061(-12-2+4) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}\u2061(-10),\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich is undefined.",
